  "limitations_markdown": "**Limitations**\n- Trained on 81 people (40 with PD, 41 without) who recorded one sustained 'aaah' over the telephone. Small data\n  means wide uncertainty: see the 95% intervals in the README.\n- The healthy group is younger on average (48 vs 67 years). Part of what any model learns may be age rather than\n  PD; an age-only model is reported as a check.\n- Live laptop or phone microphones differ from the telephone recordings used for training. Audio is band-limited\n  to telephone quality to reduce this gap, but it is not removed.\n- PD medication state, disease stage and other voice disorders were not controlled for.\n- Not validated for clinical use. Screening aid only. Consult a neurologist."
